   3: All LFM3-VL-2B versions use the same recipe and budget so that data/prompt changes are the only variable: LoRA r64 /
   4: α128 on the language model only (vision tower untouched), lr 2e-4, 1,250 optimizer steps × 32 rows (batch 8 × grad-accum 4),
   5: pixel budget 880×880, one screenshot + text history per step, output `<think>intent</think>` + one JSON action.
   6: Checkpoints were pushed to the hub every 50 steps so a lost VM could resume.
