  20: 
  21: Columns come from each run's `run_config.json` / `train_summary.json` / `train_log.jsonl` (the `source` path in
  22: `data/runs.json`). "epochs seen" = fraction of the training set covered by 1,250 × 32 rows.
  23: 
  24: ## What each version changed and what happened
  25: 
  26: | version | change | result (AndroidWorld seed 30) | lesson |
  27: |---|---|---|---|
  28: | **v1** | AndroidControl only (official train episodes, high-level goals) | 15/116 | strong action baseline; never emits `answer` |
  29: | **v2** | + GUI-Odyssey, AMEX, ScreenQA (v2 mix) | 3/116 (vs v1 0–12, p = 4.9e-04) | 8,739 rows had a **blank intent** (`<think></think>`): the model learned to act without planning |
  30: | v2 + forced intent | inference-only ablation: force a one-line intent | 6/116 | confirms the blank-intent diagnosis, not a fix |
  31: | v1 + runtime feedback | inference-only ablation: lexical app resolution + failure notes | 10/116 | worse; dropped |
  32: | **v3** | v2 mix with every intent filled | 13/116 (vs v1 4–6, p = 0.75) | offline gains on Odyssey/AMEX/ScreenQA did not transfer to AndroidWorld |
  33: | v4 (data 570febb) | first v4 build | — (abandoned before evaluation) | Codex data audit returned STOP (answer-leaking goals, guard gaps); retrained on rebuilt data |
  34: | **v4 (v4b data)** | v3 rewritten to the v4 prompt (answer-vs-complete rules + the device's installed-app list) + navigate-then-answer episodes built from AndroidControl *train* episodes (questions/answers from Qwen3-VL-8B, verified by a second call and a strict typed check) + shortened ScreenQA answers | **18/116** (6 answer + 12 action) | fixed "never answers"; passed the gate; frozen as LFM3 final |
  35: | v4-RL | 200 steps of static-screenshot GRPO from v4 (LoRA r16, KL 0.001, 4 samples/state) | not run (failed offline promotion) | answering up (0.868 → 0.890) but AndroidControl high-level step SR down (0.728 → 0.667); 60 % of groups had zero reward variance; 60 % of the state pool were terminal screens |
  36: 
  37: Other base models with the v1 recipe: Qwen3.5-2B (16/116), Qwen3.5-0.8B (12/116), LFM2.5-VL-450M (2/116). Qwen3.5-2B v2
  38: mirrors LFM3 v2 (same mix).
  39: 
  40: ## RL run details (v4-RL)
  41: 
  42: * data: alpharomercoma/AndroidAgent-RL-v4@9ba36d90 (2,000 states: 700 answer, 500 complete, 300 other, 500 click)
  43: * steps: 200, wall 0.95 h on a Colab A100, peak GPU 13.4 GB
  44: * mean reward first 20 steps 0.714 → last 20 steps 0.765
  45: * GRPO (TRL), 4 samples/state, KL beta 0.001, LoRA r16; NOT promoted (results/v4rl_promotion_offline.json)
